   ['Decide ◇','PR ≤ $150k auto · above → drafted and held for you.','EX-4472 · $214k HELD ⚠','last: 2 auto, 1 held'],
   ['Act','Writes stock + PRs; queues the held one with full reasoning.','EX-4472 · 2 PRs $96.4k ✓','last: verified by Fusion'],
